<title>USA: First Mutual Bancorp completes buyback.</title>
<headline>First Mutual Bancorp completes buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Mutual Bancorp Inc said Wednesday it completed its stock repurchase program, buying back 235,000 shares of common stock in open-market transactions at an average price of $15.93 per share.</p>
<p>First Mutual is the holding company for First Mutual Bank Bancorp SB.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
